{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6b5ed9a3193009077cc7d7f7d3fd94adbe8e5ad760cb80babfdfd5d2b0aae979", "ja": "あなたは秘密とともに", "zh": "你与秘密一同", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e161e9cc60f135e0175971915231c965a71cd087e19700f06e3d5eff000b5353", "ja": "星梨花は、打ち明ける秘密がない事に悩んで\nいた。これだとPVも上手くできないし、み\nんなと仲良くなれないと凹む。その時、どこ\nからともなく可憐の声が。姿を見せた可憐は\n先に自分の秘密を打ち明けると言った。", "zh": "星梨花因为没有可以倾诉的秘密而烦恼。这样下去，不仅没法顺利拍好PV，也无法和大家打成一片，她因此情绪低落。就在这时，不知从哪里传来了可怜的声音。现身的可怜说，她会先告诉星梨花自己的秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7af54dd3601d74e55c64184dd402519ef73b4b9aaa5d3ffd3a73de32733c47c4", "ja": "（秘密の会のおかげで、みんなPV撮影の\nイメージがだいぶ掴めてきたみたいだな）", "zh": "（多亏了秘密分享会，大家似乎都已经大致抓住PV拍摄的感觉了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "033601aea94b31aa84773558c12bde85260b79ecf61712a2524029c5ec8f855e", "ja": "あとは、今回の公演内容を考えて……\nうん、機材の発注もリストアップ出来たな。", "zh": "接下来再考虑一下这次公演的内容……\n嗯，器材的订购清单也列好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "9e89776f42390f19470dc4d245ec6bf5ae7b0bf842baabe0b435ffe28412e412", "ja": "あのっ、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "77989aed7e20a73ed5c1fe01b196f94fedbd8cf2ca6abdcfd98fbcb9ebdd2b5e", "ja": "星梨花じゃないか。あれっ、もしかして\n例の会、もう始まる時間だったか？", "zh": "这不是星梨花吗？咦，难道说，那个聚会已经到开始的时间了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "19aaa627083ee12b934ce98b2a04f756408c2e5049eacffd6704bce526dc7009", "ja": "あっ、それは大丈夫です。\nまだ時間じゃないですから。", "zh": "啊，那个没关系的。\n还没到时间呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "5f5f81748bbe67bb732748ae698e04c32270d2f20397b430adbfd4d8c3b10411", "ja": "実はわたし、{$P$}さんに\n聞いてほしいことがあって……。", "zh": "其实我有一件事，\n想跟{$P$}先生说说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "759c3813d12fecb037ef05d4853680771013b1fd14ba91b9ca5842396f89a644", "ja": "何か相談事か？\nもちろん、何でも話してくれ。", "zh": "是有什么烦恼吗？\n当然，什么都可以跟我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "1e70b6b210a72e7d1cb362e92121197dc118028b0eb73f08b4366b24d994fab3", "ja": "あの……わたしたち、それぞれ\n秘密を持ち寄って、お話していますよね？", "zh": "那个……我们大家，是不是\n每个人都带着秘密，聚在一起聊天呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4a165c463dd42403da27538dbf5324fd8fb4f09e8140a51b12794639f30682c3", "ja": "ああ。今日もその秘密を持ち寄る会だな。\n可憐の番だったと思うけど……。", "zh": "啊，今天也是交换秘密的聚会呢。\n我记得该轮到可怜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "61752704f8b61d07b20099123358a19e0cf89a886ceaab99d24920566c859f89", "ja": "はい。可憐さんの次、\n最後はわたしです。", "zh": "是的。可怜之后，最后轮到我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c1fad9b65b4befd19369d4dd00884f525f9be415be70d759cb8fd3eea02a5d87", "ja": "でも、その……わたし、みんなに\n打ち明ける秘密が、見つからないんです……。", "zh": "可是，那个……我找不到要向大家坦白的秘密……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a95adf64591a0beebee96a86da124a6c4136d59040f5d10517b2749f6f50cab4", "ja": "秘密が見つからない？", "zh": "找不到秘密？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "723233de8968acfcb4f431f9ed9e9e31a2ded53ca134a31b6b4abf83cfa50ccf", "ja": "はい。みんなにお話してないことは、\nもちろんあります。あるにはあるんですけど……。", "zh": "是的。当然有些事情我还没跟大家说过。是有那么一些啦，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "9e991ed978188d09a7b6216a44b869c89893ecd1badae9adea64a45b81690be6", "ja": "でも、それはまだ話してない\nだけなんです。えっと……。", "zh": "不过，只是还没说出来而已。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4fe46715a7378e955c6902a6ba6126e80506792ff926d8f80dee5045016ef2cd", "ja": "それは星梨花にとって照れくさいことだったり、\n隠している事ではない……って意味かな？", "zh": "你的意思是，那对星梨花来说并不是什么难为情、也不是什么需要隐瞒的事……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "8b08514c6f94e9fa4b845c6af9acc3e7503222fec8ac7a3b98b09154f67633d4", "ja": "そうなんです！　聞かれたらすぐ答えられることは、\n秘密じゃないですよね……？", "zh": "就是这样！如果被问到就能马上回答出来的事，就不算秘密了，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b4ade66e5680f0dd12e3018082439fe251a94fb16a485b0cdb278e9bef6824a", "ja": "ひなたさんや美也さんみたいな\n素敵な秘密、わたしにはないんです……。", "zh": "像日向小姐和美也小姐那样美好的秘密，我没有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "53f4c09cda2d540fd7628b771c5bfebecb4591bc63077fd71a9d62de9725ca29", "ja": "一生懸命、探したんですけど……。", "zh": "我拼命找过了，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "794ddb101db27edca743e5283faa59bccfea31594bd63a7228bb5cb56ad38103", "ja": "星梨花……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "4ceae0f660e4078c8c30e30ae744da5ae80bf034e56892e1206582b694045214", "ja": "秘密がないと、PVも上手に\n演じられないですよね……？", "zh": "如果没有秘密，就没办法把PV演好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "31d75588ef61335ea55cbd05d331e9b7692787cf3bd0fc9783d21d060b05abfa", "ja": "みんなとも、もっと、\n仲良くなれない……ですよね……？", "zh": "和大家也无法变得更加要好……对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e459ada5c598ed9c3d875f39025f2b24f88b32de3764fac579e087a378e53371", "ja": "星梨花、それは……。", "zh": "星梨花，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "d575e1da08ff5212aedd0cd9ee4155d0b0b92f40ed5cddd983f70df75d3d2e95", "ja": "そ、そんなことっ、ないよ……！", "zh": "才、才没有那种事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ef8c34afdb9081fae261fa5227a16e3733bd3b60b083f794e072b1922c6df8fe", "ja": "今の声は……可憐？", "zh": "刚才的声音是……可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "600b8d9520f281eec387590e92d8be02e5bc2dcd66bdb76bf8bbbfb010d302ac", "ja": "は、はい……！　ここにいたら、ふたりのお話が、\nき、聞こえてきちゃって……ごめんなさい！", "zh": "是、是的……！我在这里的话，不小心就听到了你们两个人的谈话……对、对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "a56d8c5e8ccad1d03873dab228419e4a594a6fac41544b8989abcec4e9ff7150", "ja": "ここに……？　{$P$}さん、\n可憐さんの姿、見えますか……？", "zh": "在这里……？{$P$}先生，你看得见可怜吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "842a069620cc5d18d47882de50027940787c83e76f0499b6a4fd687102a70c34", "ja": "いや、俺にも……\n可憐、一体どこにいるんだ？", "zh": "不，我也没……\n可怜，你到底在哪里啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "d99ed8c45f43d9023c6d624b2ac712bde2d33ef37c00c3de1358b74a3f3ac57c", "ja": "あ、えっと、説明が難しくて……そっちに向かうので、\nち、ちょっと待っててください……！", "zh": "啊，那个，这个实在很难解释……我这就过去，请、请稍等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "174890b9a7ad41ae592b1efefe0c39715cb9673a6b9115c365dbc63d520afd63", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。\nお、お待たせしました……。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……  \n让、让您久等了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4771ea5dae3c81010b2542a3e3e8360c8c49dbfa943142f93c0140dcefa13797", "ja": "可憐！　どこにいたんだ？", "zh": "可怜！你刚才去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "e9b8eb48a1b10b66a8c0b66645eafb4cfbf073ad0cb793c74612e95603d9b7b2", "ja": "こ、混乱させてしまって、すみません……！\nあの、説明の前に……。", "zh": "让、让你感到困惑了，对不起……！\n那个，在说明之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "e6bbcbeae8e147a04de3f807367bb03762a5fa40fa1b4db494d8f0c00c9fbdbc", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん……ぐ、偶然とはいえ、大事なお話、\n勝手に聞いちゃって、ごめんなさい……！", "zh": "星梨花……虽、虽然是偶然，但我还是擅自听到了这么重要的谈话，对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "3245828aaa8d6b21982d8247e1c3ffacd43f76e35b4ffef64294e6bc95aa70e1", "ja": "それは大丈夫です！　それよりも、声だけ聞こえて\n可憐さんが見えなかったのは……？", "zh": "那没关系！比起这个，只听到了声音，却没看到可怜小姐，这是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "10a0d7fecd57c0801cc6e5319e63c704d660cff1b3fd4b5903ac404034702070", "ja": "それについて、説明するね……。\nふ、ふたりとも、私についてきてくれますか……？", "zh": "关于这件事，我来解释一下……  \n你们、你们两个愿意跟我来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0139_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0139_story_05_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "39b067106e17dd4f80e57bdf02bbdad2693ad3afaccaf7fb09afc152832e7c7a", "ja": "私の、ひ、秘密……少し早いけど、\nふたりにお話しますから……。", "zh": "我的、我、我的秘密……虽然现在说还有点早，但我会告诉你们两个的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
